		(descr "LiPo battery connector: JST PH 2-pin side-entry SMD header S2B-PH-SM4-TB (LCSC C295747). Pads as KiCad Connector_JST:JST_PH_S2B-PH-SM4-TB_1x02-1MP_P2.00mm_Horizontal (JST drawing ePH.pdf). The plug goes in from +Y. The two big side pads only hold the part down. Tracks may pass under the body between the signal pads and the side pads.")
